{"id": "farrell-campaign-shared-expense-settlement", "title": "How shared campaign expenses led to a $108,179.99 Farrell committee penalty", "seconds": 46.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "0c33c42d87c75816", "words": 134, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two committees shared campaign costs. One faced a 500 dollar contribution limit.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.64, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "committee", "paid", "the", "staff", "costs?"], "sub": "Farrell campaign committees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.62, 0.9, 1.38, 2.07, 2.34, 2.62, 2.72, 3.0, 3.26, 3.56, 4.17]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Staff costs were split evenly without records showing an equal division of work.", "t0": 4.76, "t1": 8.52, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "Shared staff expenses", "mark": "Shared staff expenses"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.7, 0.84, 1.16, 1.54, 1.89, 2.26, 2.61, 2.72, 2.99, 3.4, 3.5]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The order separated the contributions returned late from those never refunded.", "t0": 8.64, "t1": 12.46, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Prohibited contributions", "heading": "Contributions in the order", "source": "order", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Returned after deadlines", "value": "$98,866.45"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Never refunded", "value": "$93,350.03"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 0.95, 1.07, 1.84, 2.23, 2.46, 2.64, 2.94, 3.27]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The order counted 192,216.48 dollars.", "t0": 12.58, "t1": 17.16, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$192,216.48", "label": "Total prohibited contributions in the order"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.42, 0.79, 0.98, 1.28, 1.83, 2.23, 2.42, 2.7, 3.14, 3.53, 3.66, 4.18]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "In November 2024 the Ethics Commission unanimously approved a civil penalty.", "t0": 17.28, "t1": 22.15, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "November 8, 2024", "mark": "November 8, 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.64, 0.94, 1.91, 2.1, 2.4, 2.88, 3.6, 4.01, 4.11, 4.42]}, {"scene": "payment", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "The penalty was 108,179.99 dollars.", "t0": 22.37, "t1": 27.33, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$108,179.99", "label": "Civil penalty ordered"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.53, 0.73, 0.93, 1.3, 1.51, 2.0, 2.17, 2.58, 3.21, 3.72, 3.98, 4.54]}, {"scene": "payment", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[3]"], "text": "Both committees reported payments in their January 2025 filings.", "t0": 27.45, "t1": 31.17, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "January 2025 filings", "heading": "Payments reported by committee", "source": "payments", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Proposition D committee", "value": "$81,134.99"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "Mayoral committee", "value": "$27,044.99"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.65, 1.08, 1.47, 1.57, 1.76, 2.3, 2.61, 3.18]}, {"scene": "payment", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[3]"], "text": "Their reported payments total one cent less than the order.", "t0": 31.29, "t1": 34.0, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "One-cent difference"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.59, 1.0, 1.34, 1.55, 1.87, 2.1, 2.25, 2.4]}, {"scene": "payment", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The treasurer had no personal liability for the penalty.", "t0": 34.12, "t1": 36.84, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Treasurer"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.56, 0.79, 1.03, 1.41, 2.02, 2.15, 2.26]}, {"scene": "payment", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "The 2026 audit treated these transactions as already settled.", "t0": 36.96, "t1": 40.54, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "later", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "March 2026 audit", "mark": "March 2026 audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 1.05, 1.34, 1.69, 1.88, 2.62, 2.76, 3.2]}, {"scene": "payment", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "A City receipt or reconciliation would resolve the difference.", "t0": 40.66, "t1": 43.63, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["City receipt", "Reconciliation"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.78, 0.92, 1.79, 1.98, 2.38, 2.48]}, {"scene": "payment", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 43.75, "t1": 45.86, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Shared campaign expenses", "payment": "Reported settlement payments"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "contrast"}